# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & generated state — NEVER commit these.
# The repo ships only *.example templates; the real files are generated on the
# VPS by bin/bootstrap.sh / bin/install.sh and live under /etc and /var/lib.
# These patterns are defense-in-depth in case anyone copies generated files in.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Shared anvil mnemonic / env (the master secret for the devnet)
**/anvil.env
.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

# Caddy basic-auth material (bcrypt hashes + the username->hash registry)
**/*.basicauth
**/*.users.tsv
!**/*.example

# Cloudflare Tunnel credentials & cert
**/cloudflared/*.json
**/cert.pem
**/*.pem
**/config.yml
!**/config.yml.example

# anvil chain state + deployment manifests (regenerated, machine-specific)
**/state.json
**/deployments.json

# Foundry build output (if contracts get compiled locally)
**/out/
**/cache/
**/broadcast/
**/.foundry/

# Local, per-developer Claude Code settings (not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json
